
@host = https://localhost:7232

### 1. Test Supplier Health API

GET {{host}}/health


### 2. Validate Supplier Registration

POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/validate-registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lanka Agro Suppliers",
  "email": "supplier@example.com",
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "address": "Pannala, Kurunegala",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 3. Register Supplier

POST {{host}}/api/suppliers/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lanka Agro Suppliers",
  "email": "supplier@example.com",
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "address": "Pannala, Kurunegala",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 4. Supplier Login

POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "password": "TestPass123!"
}


### 5. Verify Supplier OTP

POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "otp": "123456"
}


### 6. Test Invalid OTP

POST {{host}}/api/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "otp": "123"
}


### 7. Get Supplier Profile

GET {{host}}/api/suppliers/me


### 8. Update Supplier Profile

PUT {{host}}/api/suppliers/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lanka Agro Suppliers",
  "email": "lankaagro@example.com",
  "contact": "0771234567",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "address": "Pannala, Kurunegala"
}


### 9. Test Invalid Profile Data

PUT {{host}}/api/suppliers/me
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lanka Agro Suppliers",
  "email": "invalid-email",
  "contact": "123",
  "district": "Kurunegala",
  "address": "Pannala"
}



### 10. Get My Inventory
GET https://localhost:7232/api/inventory


### 11. Get Inventory Item
GET https://localhost:7232/api/inventory/1


### 12. Create Inventory Item
POST https://localhost:7232/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Urea Fertilizer",
  "qty": 100,
  "unit": "bags",
  "price": 8500
}


### 13. Update Inventory Item
PUT https://localhost:7232/api/inventory/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "qty": 75,
  "price": 8200
}


### 14. Delete Inventory Item
DELETE https://localhost:7232/api/inventory/1


### 15. Get Stock History
GET https://localhost:7232/api/inventory/stock-history


### 16. Get Supplier Stock for Farmers
GET https://localhost:7232/api/inventory/supplier-stock?district=Kurunegala&search=Urea


### 17. Test Invalid Inventory Quantity
POST https://localhost:7232/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Urea Fertilizer",
  "qty": -10,
  "unit": "bags",
  "price": 8500
}


### 18. Test Invalid Inventory Unit
POST https://localhost:7232/api/inventory
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "item": "Urea Fertilizer",
  "qty": 100,
  "unit": "boxes",
  "price": 8500
}



### 19. Get Farmer Supply Requests

GET https://localhost:7232/api/quotations/supply-requests


### 20. Get Open Requests for Quotation

GET https://localhost:7232/api/quotations/supply-requests?onlyOpen=true


### 21. Get My Quotations

GET https://localhost:7232/api/quotations


### 22. Get Quotation by ID

GET https://localhost:7232/api/quotations/1


### 23. Create Supplier Quotation

POST https://localhost:7232/api/quotations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": 1,
  "price": 45000,
  "stock": 100,
  "delivery": "3 days"
}


### 24. Update Supplier Quotation

PUT https://localhost:7232/api/quotations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 42000,
  "stock": 100,
  "delivery": "2 days"
}


